{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 995016,
  "courseSlug": "vuejs-2-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Vue - The Complete Guide (incl. Router & Composition API)",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21879794",
      "title": "Namespacing Modules",
      "lectureOrder": 225,
      "videoOrder": 198,
      "sourceHash": "897c8ca7cbcce697c7c748afb23b931039ea1dc397b2dc601f14409efc1268c1",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.26,
          "end": 4.46,
          "en": "Now besides this local state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.46,
          "end": 7.7,
          "en": "you can also make the entire module local.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.7,
          "end": 11.75,
          "en": "You can make it name spaced, as it's called,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.75,
          "end": 14.56,
          "en": "to make sure that multiple modules",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.56,
          "end": 17.35,
          "en": "are clearly separated from each other.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.35,
          "end": 20.22,
          "en": "Now why might you wanna do that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.22,
          "end": 22.49,
          "en": "Well, as you're application grows,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.49,
          "end": 25.32,
          "en": "you could of course have name clashes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.32,
          "end": 29.21,
          "en": "You might be using the same getter or the same action name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.21,
          "end": 33.19,
          "en": "in different modules of the same store.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.19,
          "end": 34.38,
          "en": "It's not the case here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.38,
          "end": 36.63,
          "en": "but if for whatever reason",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.63,
          "end": 40.41,
          "en": "we had a login action here, in the counter module,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.41,
          "end": 44.65,
          "en": "that would be clashing with the login action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.65,
          "end": 46.363,
          "en": "we got in our main store.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.51,
          "end": 49.94,
          "en": "Because at the moment, besides the state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.94,
          "end": 53.963,
          "en": "everything is merged together into one object basically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.15,
          "end": 57.68,
          "en": "So in bigger apps, you could have such clashes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.68,
          "end": 62.68,
          "en": "and to avoid that you can name space modules.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 63.5,
          "end": 65.87,
          "en": "You do that by adding an extra option,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.87,
          "end": 67.86,
          "en": "inside of your object here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.86,
          "end": 70.21000000000001,
          "en": "and that's the name spaced option",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.21000000000001,
          "end": 71.593,
          "en": "which you can set to true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.56,
          "end": 75.75,
          "en": "If you add name spaced true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.75,
          "end": 79.03,
          "en": "you tell vuex that now the entire module",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.03,
          "end": 82.92,
          "en": "and not just the state should be kinda detached",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.92,
          "end": 84.483,
          "en": "from the rest of the store.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.33,
          "end": 88.28,
          "en": "If you do that though, you will now notice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.75,
          "end": 94.363,
          "en": "that our getters and our action dispatchers no longer work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 95.2,
          "end": 98.34,
          "en": "Because now these actions and getters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 98.34,
          "end": 101.82,
          "en": "are no longer available on the main store.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 101.82,
          "end": 104.03999999999999,
          "en": "Instead now we have to access them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 104.03999999999999,
          "end": 107.22,
          "en": "by specifying the correct name space.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 107.22,
          "end": 109.763,
          "en": "And how does it work and what is the name space?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 110.82,
          "end": 114.93,
          "en": "Well, the name space is this key you assigned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 114.93,
          "end": 119.93,
          "en": "for adding the module in this modules object to your store.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 121.54,
          "end": 123.66,
          "en": "So in my case, numbers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 123.66,
          "end": 127.35,
          "en": "That's the name space off the counter module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.35,
          "end": 129.82,
          "en": "And we now need to use this name space",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 129.82,
          "end": 132.79,
          "en": "to work with actions, getters and so on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 132.79,
          "end": 134.363,
          "en": "inside of this module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 135.87,
          "end": 137.51,
          "en": "Now here's how that will work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 137.51,
          "end": 142.44,
          "en": "In favorite value, I access my normalized counter getter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 142.44,
          "end": 145.8,
          "en": "Now you don't access dot normalized counter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.8,
          "end": 148.12,
          "en": "but instead a special property name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 148.12,
          "end": 150.09,
          "en": "which contains a special character,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 150.09,
          "end": 151.36,
          "en": "in which you hence have to access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 151.36,
          "end": 153.63,
          "en": "with this square bracket notation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 153.63,
          "end": 158.09,
          "en": "You pass in a string here, your property name as a string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 158.09,
          "end": 161.32999999999998,
          "en": "and this property name is now made up of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 161.32999999999998,
          "end": 165.7,
          "en": "the old property name, so normalized counter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 165.7,
          "end": 168.31,
          "en": "but prior to that, in front of that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 168.31,
          "end": 170.55,
          "en": "you have your name space.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 170.55,
          "end": 172.59300000000002,
          "en": "So in my case, numbers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 174.27,
          "end": 178.57,
          "en": "So you have numbers and then a slash in between.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 178.57,
          "end": 179.66,
          "en": "Might look strange",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 179.66,
          "end": 183.053,
          "en": "but this is now the property name of the normalized counter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 184.17,
          "end": 187.5,
          "en": "name space, slash and then your getter name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 187.5,
          "end": 189.22,
          "en": "action name, whatever it is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 189.22,
          "end": 190.62,
          "en": "In this case, it's a getter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 192.53,
          "end": 195.2,
          "en": "And that's when we now see at least one counter here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 195.2,
          "end": 197.04,
          "en": "it's this normalized counter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 197.04,
          "end": 198.59,
          "en": "which I'm outputting like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 199.97,
          "end": 203.7,
          "en": "Now if you are using map getters,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 203.7,
          "end": 207.063,
          "en": "you pass a first argument to map getters,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 207.98,
          "end": 211.39,
          "en": "which is your name space, in this case numbers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 211.39,
          "end": 213.76,
          "en": "and then there after you still add your array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 213.76,
          "end": 216.6,
          "en": "with the getter names as before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 216.6,
          "end": 218.52,
          "en": "So with that if we save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 218.52,
          "end": 220.523,
          "en": "the second counter is back as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 222.02,
          "end": 224.12,
          "en": "So name space as a first argument,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 224.12,
          "end": 227.04,
          "en": "second argument is then still your array of getters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 227.04,
          "end": 228.653,
          "en": "inside of that name space.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 230.64,
          "end": 232.97,
          "en": "And the same of course for the other parts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 232.97,
          "end": 236.73,
          "en": "Map actions takes name space as a first argument",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 236.73,
          "end": 240,
          "en": "and then your action names as before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 240,
          "end": 245,
          "en": "And in app vue, here we're at dispatch,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 245.45,
          "end": 247.48,
          "en": "where I dispatch manually actually,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 247.48,
          "end": 251.793,
          "en": "the type is now numbers slash increase.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 252.92,
          "end": 256.423,
          "en": "So again, name space slash and then the action name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 258.44,
          "end": 262.38,
          "en": "With that, all the buttons work again now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 262.38,
          "end": 265.17,
          "en": "and now we're using this name space in the future",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 265.17,
          "end": 269.14,
          "en": "to detach our module and to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 269.14,
          "end": 272.17,
          "en": "that we don't have any name clashes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 272.17,
          "end": 274.05,
          "en": "which we of course don't have here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 274.05,
          "end": 276.983,
          "en": "but which you in bigger apps definitely could have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 278.23,
          "end": 282.12,
          "en": "And with that, we're merging a module with our main store,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 282.12,
          "end": 284.63,
          "en": "we still have some global state in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 284.63,
          "end": 286.46,
          "en": "the authentication state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 286.46,
          "end": 288.87,
          "en": "but we can absolutely combine it like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 288.87,
          "end": 291.23,
          "en": "and we're even name spacing our module",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 291.23,
          "end": 293.81,
          "en": "to make sure that we don't accidentally",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 293.81,
          "end": 296.54,
          "en": "trigger an action inside of this module",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 296.54,
          "end": 299.93,
          "en": "when we actually wanted to trigger a global action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 299.93,
          "end": 300.923,
          "en": "for example.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
